lci
------------------------------------------
Lci is a LOLCODE interpreter written in C and is designed to be correct,
portable, fast, and precisely documented.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/justinmeza/lci

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/justinmeza/lci/archive/v1.3.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack lci-1.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./lci-1.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/lci-1.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/lci-1.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(lci)
  /usr/bin/lci.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/lci.README
  /usr/share/doc/lci/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/lci/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/lci/lci.png

